{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Messages｜发布、Current结算与复制流程\n上方：逐Modifier结算/重入/发布；下方：复制历史与客户端Max投影。\n[[Messages/结构|契约文档]] · [[GGYGO_结构_Messages.canvas|结构图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|上游伤害流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pre",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GAS → PreGameplayEffectExecute\n输入本Modifier属性、原幅度与EffectSpec。\n免疫/数值校验；meta以当前Current调用ASC换算做支持性预检，不保存候选Base。\n通过建原帧；拒绝诊断并不留下帧。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "write",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GAS写值 → PostAttributeChange\n输入Attribute及实际Old/New。\nmeta首次写 → 记录本Modifier实际贡献。\n资源写 → 保存本次OwnPost、Changed与归零锁存，先于native委托。\nMax下调 → 权威TrySetCurrentValue(资源, NewMax)；客户端RequestClientMaxReevaluation。\n新嵌套GE优先配对，native随后可重入。",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "post",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PostGameplayEffectExecute\n配对原Modifier；Damage先排原幅度候选。\nmeta先GAS setter扣自身贡献；其native回调返回后重读Current/Max，计算目标并调用TrySetCurrentValue。\n直接属性不重复写；原帧准确移除。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "nested",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## native委托 → 合法GAS重入\n新GE再走PreGameplayEffectExecute，独立配对Modifier；普通setter走原属性入口。\n原标记只消费一次，后续写入不归旧帧。\n仍有Modifier/属性联动时，FlushPendingResults暂不发布。",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "publish",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FlushPendingResults → 发布事实\n同步Modifier与属性联动均退出后，先swap结果到局部数组。\n按顺序发Changed/死亡/破韧委托；消息逐项调用PublishMessageResult。\n旧结果不覆盖回调的新GAS状态。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "rep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 复制 → OnRep_Health/OnRep_Poise\nBeginRepNotifyFrame：原weak Outer/ASC及注册校验。\nGAS宏内：GE/Expected/Base配对优先；其余写入按阶段处理。\n未判定 → 抑制已有聚合器回退；最终写 → 捕获一次有效值/提交锁存。\nOnAttributeAggregatorCreated：迟到创建后的写入为真实变化。\nEndRepNotifyFrame：宏Scope先清帧。\nincoming/有效历史 → Changed及真实归零委托；不回写旧锁存，不重建GameplayMessage。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的复制调用作用域|复制阶段与来源契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## RegisterListener → 只读消费\nBroadcastMessage按Verb同步调用已注册回调。\n载荷是原事件事实，实时ASC可已有后续变化。\n复制所需数据；结束使用时Unregister。",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "next",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 返回GAS / 后续Modifier\nInternalExecuteMod逐个执行Modifier。\nHealth/Poise不作为同GE原子事务；消息不能代替整个命中的最终快照。\n回调的新GE取得独立帧，沿原GAS入口执行。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "calculate-current",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## TrySetCurrentValue → ASC换算/提交\n输入meta清理后目标，或权威Max下调目标。\nTryCalculateNumericAttributeBaseForCurrentValue(this, Attribute, ExpectedCurrent, DesiredCurrent)。\nReady/None → SetNumericAttributeBase(CalculatedBase) → 原Post保存本标记的实际值。\nOwnPost确认本次目标；随后native重入改变Current不改写此事实。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current契约]]",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "current-rejected",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 拒绝 / 来源变更 / 未确认\nRejected/Stale或仍开放native batch → 明确诊断。\n元属性已消费时不伪造整体GE回滚；只撤原帧未确认Damage候选。\n原帧移除后Flush；保留其它已发生属性事实，不用另一资源/默认值代替结算。",
      "x": 1890,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "delivery-lifecycle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PublishMessageResult(Result)\n真实Set/Actor销毁、World teardown/cleanup或GI销毁 → Retired。\n无效Owner或缺World/GI/Router → DependencyFailure＋定位诊断；恢复前按原因抑制重复。\n依赖有效 → BroadcastMessage(Verb, Message)，返回Delivered；无BeginPlay/监听者门槛。\n失败不撤结算/跳属性委托，不创建Router、不重播旧事件。\n[[Messages/结构#Router 生命周期与发布|投递结果]]",
      "x": 1890,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "client-max-request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PreNetReceive / Max复制 → 请求\nPreNetReceive保存原weak Owner/ASC，再Super进入native batch。\nMax的Post或OnRep_MaxHealth/MaxPoise宏返回后Current超限 → RequestClientMaxReevaluation；覆盖无Max聚合器分支。\n本次接收只记属性请求；PostNetReceive先Super排空dirty，再移除本帧/消费原请求。\n无接收且batch关闭的OnRep可同步执行。",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "client-max-project",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ReevaluateClientMax → 原生同Base\n重验原来源/注册/客户端模式/batch关闭，重读真实Base/Current/Max。\nCurrent已在界内 → 无额外写入；仍超限 → SetNumericAttributeBase(Attribute, 同一Base)。\n原生重新聚合/PreAttributeChange限制Current，单次标记确认实际Post。\n只产生该次真实属性/边沿委托；其后native真实GE/setter仍独立处理。\n[[Messages/结构#客户端上限的 NetReceive 投影|客户端投影]]",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "client-max-rejected",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 投影请求失效 / 拒绝\n来源/注册失配 → 退休请求并诊断。\n仍开放batch、错误权威模式、非法数值或未确认实际Post → 明确失败。\n请求已先清理，不跨帧等待/重试，不假报提交，不发该投影的GameplayMessage。",
      "x": 1890,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "fromNode": "pre",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "write",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "校验/支持性预检通过→GAS应用本Modifier"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "fromNode": "write",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "post",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "引擎逐 Modifier Post"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "fromNode": "write",
